          "3. **Verify PHP-FPM Worker Restart:** Confirm with `systemctl restart php8.x-fpm` (or rolling pod restart in Kubernetes) that old workers aren't still serving requests.",
          "4. **Audit FastCGI Keepalive & `php://input`:** Temporarily disable `fastcgi_keep_conn on;` in Nginx if you have a legacy server you cannot patch tonight."
        ]
      }
